                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16151857" author="dsetrakyan" created="Sun, 3 Sep 2017 16:44:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We must check the Java version on startup and throw an exception with proper error message is the Java version is incompatible.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16158322" author="dkarachentsev" created="Fri, 8 Sep 2017 08:49:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue is fixed in JDK 1.7.0_71. For previous releases helps disabling JIT for OffheapReadWriteLock, f.e. for Oracle JDK: -XX:CompileCommand=exclude,org/apache/ignite/internal/util/OffheapReadWriteLock,*&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16220410" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 26 Oct 2017 13:18:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user dkarachentsev opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2931&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2931&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6248&quot; title=&quot;Check Java 7 builds for compatibility with Ignite and update documentation&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6248&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6248&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Throw exception on unsupported Java 1.7 releases.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&lt;/a&gt; ignite-6248&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2931.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2931.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #2931&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 0608fc55a03c3cd72b6a7b616703976f5d2f34f7&lt;br/&gt;
Author: dkarachentsev &amp;lt;dkarachentsev@gridgain.com&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2017-10-26T13:17:30Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6248&quot; title=&quot;Check Java 7 builds for compatibility with Ignite and update documentation&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6248&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6248&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Throw exception on unsupported Java 1.7 releases.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
